Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 760
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Type "HOME=$PWD/demo/home /tmp/stash-demo --all"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "j"
Sleep 350ms
Type "j"
Sleep 350ms

Type "/"
Type "oss"
Enter
Sleep 700ms

Right
Sleep 500ms
Right
Sleep 500ms
Tab
Sleep 500ms
Type "q"
